WEBVTT

00:16:28.996 --> 00:16:33.746
I would describe this moment in my life
and career as blank and blank,

00:16:34.121 --> 00:16:35.829
and I wish I could blank

00:16:38.246 --> 00:16:42.621
I would describe this moment in my career
business as completely new and uncharted,

00:16:43.162 --> 00:16:45.121
and I wish I could keep moving through it.

00:16:45.537 --> 00:16:51.412
I would describe this moment in my career
in business as new and unpredictable,

00:16:51.621 --> 00:16:53.662
and I wish I could see the future.

00:16:53.996 --> 00:16:56.162
I would describe this moment in my career.

00:16:56.204 --> 00:16:59.329
Business is stuck and starting
to generate new ideas,

00:16:59.621 --> 00:17:03.079
and I wish I could figure out how to split
my time between my current project